 | `--overwrite` | Off | Replace existing output files |

+Offline pitch extraction preserves detected unvoiced frames as zero frequency, including during pitch shifts. Synthesis and consonant protection use these zeros. Lower `--protect` values retain more original features in unvoiced frames; `0.5` disables that feature protection. `--index-rate` controls the separate retrieval blend. These controls do not guarantee natural pronunciation or speaker similarity across languages.
+
 Successful completion returns exit code 0, an inference failure returns 1, and user interruption returns 130.

